*   **Instagram session:** Sign out in Settings to delete stored session cookies.
*   **Deletion:** Uninstalling the app removes all locally stored app data. Because we do not operate servers or accounts, we hold no personal data about you; requests regarding data held by Google services can be sent to us and we will assist.

### 5. Security
